//  Shared chat-bubble ICON sheet. Five 16x16 cells.
//
//  x        deposit or action refused
//  box      any item whose inventoryIcon is a drawable LIST rather than a path
//  sword    generated melee weapon
//  gun      generated ranged weapon
//  blank    deliberately empty -- an unused icon slot
//
//  WHY box, sword AND gun EXIST
//
//  root.itemConfig returns inventoryIcon as EITHER a path string or a list of
//  layered drawables. An animator part image is a single path, so the list case
//  has no faithful rendering and needs a stand-in. Generated weapons are the
//  overwhelming majority of that case, so they get the two specific icons and
//  everything else falls through to the box.
//
//  SEPARATE SHEET FROM bubble.png ON PURPOSE. One .frames carries one
//  frameGrid, and these are 16x16 while the backings are 64x32.
//
//  PLACEHOLDER ART.

{
	"frameGrid" : {
		"size" : [16, 16],
		"dimensions" : [5, 1],
		"names" : [
			[ "x", "box", "sword", "gun", "blank" ]
		]
	}
}
